{
 "slug": "css3_shadows",
 "course": "css",
 "order": 124,
 "url": "/css/css3_shadows.asp",
 "title": "CSS Shadow Effects",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "type": "h1",
   "text": "CSS Shadow Effects"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "With CSS you can create shadow effects!"
  },
  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "CSS Text Shadow"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "The CSS text-shadow property applies\na shadow to text."
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "In its simplest use, you only specify the horizontal and the vertical shadow."
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "In addition, you can add a shadow color and blur effect."
  },
  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Text shadow effect!"
  },
  {
   "type": "code",
   "lang": "css",
   "text": "h1\n{\n\n  text-shadow: 2px 2px;\n\n}",
   "caption": "Example"
  },
  {
   "type": "tryit",
   "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=trycss3_text-shadow1"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "Next, add a color to the shadow:"
  },
  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Text shadow effect!"
  },
  {
   "type": "code",
   "lang": "css",
   "text": "h1\n{\n\n  text-shadow: 2px 2px red;\n\n}",
   "caption": "Example"
  },
  {
   "type": "tryit",
   "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=trycss3_text-shadow2"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "Then, add a blur effect to the shadow:"
  },
  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Text shadow effect!"
  },
  {
   "type": "code",
   "lang": "css",
   "text": "h1\n{\n\n  text-shadow: 2px 2px 5px red;\n\n}",
   "caption": "Example"
  },
  {
   "type": "tryit",
   "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=trycss3_text-shadow3"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "The following example shows a white text with black shadow:"
  },
  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Text shadow effect!"
  },
  {
   "type": "code",
   "lang": "css",
   "text": "h1\n{\n\n  color: white;\n\n  text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px #000000;\n\n}",
   "caption": "Example"
  },
  {
   "type": "tryit",
   "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=trycss3_text-shadow4"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "The following example shows a red neon glow shadow:"
  },
  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Text shadow effect!"
  },
  {
   "type": "code",
   "lang": "css",
   "text": "h1\n{\n\n  text-shadow: 0 0 3px #ff0000;\n\n}",
   "caption": "Example"
  },
  {
   "type": "tryit",
   "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=trycss3_text-shadow5"
  },
  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Multiple Shadows"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "To add more than one shadow to the text, you can add a comma-separated list of shadows."
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "The following example shows a red and blue neon glow shadow:"
  },
  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Text shadow effect!"
  },
  {
   "type": "code",
   "lang": "css",
   "text": "h1\n{\n\n  text-shadow: 0 0 3px #ff0000, 0 0 5px #0000ff;\n\n}",
   "caption": "Example"
  },
  {
   "type": "tryit",
   "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=trycss3_text-shadow6"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "The following example shows a white text with black, blue, and darkblue shadow:"
  },
  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Text shadow effect!"
  },
  {
   "type": "code",
   "lang": "css",
   "text": "h1\n{\n  color: white;\n\n  text-shadow: 1px 1px 2px black, 0 0 25px blue, 0 0 5px darkblue;\n}",
   "caption": "Example"
  },
  {
   "type": "tryit",
   "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=trycss3_text-shadow7"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "You can also use the text-shadow property to create a plain border around\nsome text (without shadows):"
  },
  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Border around text!"
  },
  {
   "type": "code",
   "lang": "css",
   "text": "h1\n{\n  color: coral;\n  text-shadow: -1px 0 black, 0 1px\n    black, 1px 0 black, 0 -1px black;\n}",
   "caption": "Example"
  },
  {
   "type": "tryit",
   "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=trycss3_text-shadow_border"
  }
 ]
}